# Marketing ROI Calculator

A free and open-source marketing performance calculator built with HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

## Features

- Calculate Return on Ad Spend (ROAS).
- Calculate Marketing ROI.
- Calculate Cost Per Lead (CPL).
- Calculate Cost Per Acquisition (CPA).
- Calculate Conversion Rate.
- View campaign performance metrics.

## Technology

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## Purpose

This project aims to help digital marketers, agencies and business owners understand their advertising campaign performance through simple calculations.

## Future Improvements

- Campaign comparison.
- Performance charts.
- Downloadable reports.
- CSV data import.
- Campaign history.

